{"seq":2,"slug":"isolation-sandbox","title":"隔离与沙箱机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/isolation-sandbox","wordCount":979,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"隔离与沙箱机制\">隔离与沙箱机制</h1><p>多个子应用共享同一个浏览器 Tab 时，它们共用 <code>window</code>、<code>document</code>、CSS 全局作用域和事件系统。如果不做隔离，一个子应用对全局变量的修改会污染其他应用，CSS 样式会互相覆盖，事件监听器会意外触发。沙箱机制的核心目标是：在同一个运行环境中为每个子应用制造出「独立空间」的错觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>隔离可以发生在三个层面，每一层的隔离强度和实现成本不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[隔离层面] --&gt; B[JS 沙箱]&#10;    A --&gt; C[CSS 隔离]&#10;    A --&gt; D[DOM 隔离]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Proxy 代理]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[iframe 物理隔离]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[快照沙箱]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Scoped CSS]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Shadow DOM]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[CSS Modules]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[独立挂载点]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Shadow Root]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[iframe 文档]\">graph LR\n    A[隔离层面] --&gt; B[JS 沙箱]\n    A --&gt; C[CSS 隔离]\n    A --&gt; D[DOM 隔离]\n    B --&gt; B1[Proxy 代理]\n    B --&gt; B2[iframe 物理隔离]\n    B --&gt; B3[快照沙箱]\n    C --&gt; C1[Scoped CSS]\n    C --&gt; C2[Shadow DOM]\n    C --&gt; C3[CSS Modules]\n    D --&gt; D1[独立挂载点]\n    D --&gt; D2[Shadow Root]\n    D --&gt; D3[iframe 文档]</pre><h2 id=\"js-沙箱的三代演进\">JS 沙箱的三代演进</h2><h3 id=\"第一代-快照沙箱-snapshot-sandbox\">第一代：快照沙箱（Snapshot Sandbox）</h3><p>qiankun 1.x 的早期方案。子应用激活时对 <code>window</code> 做一次快照，卸载时恢复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 伪代码：快照沙箱的核心逻辑&#10;const snapshot = {};&#10;function activate() {&#10;  for (const key in window) {&#10;    snapshot[key] = window[key];&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;function deactivate() {&#10;  for (const key in window) {&#10;    if (window[key] !== snapshot[key]) {&#10;      window[key] = snapshot[key]; // 恢复&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 伪代码：快照沙箱的核心逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> activate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    snapshot[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window[key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deactivate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapshot[key]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      window[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapshot[key]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>致命缺陷：不支持多个子应用同时激活（同一时刻只能有一个子应用「拥有」window）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二代-proxy-代理沙箱\">第二代：Proxy 代理沙箱</h3><p>利用 ES6 Proxy 拦截对 <code>window</code> 的读写，为每个子应用创建一个代理对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createProxySandbox(appName: string) {&#10;  const fakeWindow = Object.create(null);&#10;  const proxy = new Proxy(fakeWindow, {&#10;    get(target, key) {&#10;      return key in target ? target[key] : window[key];&#10;    },&#10;    set(target, key, value) {&#10;      target[key] = value;&#10;      return true;&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;  return proxy;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createProxySandbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">appName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fakeWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> proxy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Proxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fakeWindow, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window[key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      target[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proxy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：多实例可并存；劣势：无法拦截对原生 API 的直接调用（如 <code>document.querySelector</code>），第三方库可能绕过 Proxy。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三代-iframe-物理隔离\">第三代：iframe 物理隔离</h3><p>wujie 的核心方案。在隐藏 iframe 中执行子应用的 JS，通过 Web Components 将渲染结果代理回主文档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Proxy 沙箱</th>\n<th>iframe 物理隔离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JS 隔离强度</td>\n<td>中（可被绕过）</td>\n<td>强（独立执行上下文）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多实例并存</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存开销</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（每个 iframe 是独立文档）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DOM 访问</td>\n<td>同文档</td>\n<td>需代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能影响</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（postMessage 通信开销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方库兼容性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"css-隔离策略\">CSS 隔离策略</h2><p>CSS 污染是微前端最高频的线上 Bug 来源之一。主流方案从弱到强排列：</p>\n<h3 id=\"scoped-css-选择器前缀\">Scoped CSS（选择器前缀）</h3><p>qiankun 的 <code>experimentalStyleIsolation</code> 通过动态重写 CSS 选择器，为每条规则添加 <code>[data-qiankun=&quot;appName&quot;]</code> 属性选择器前缀：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 原始规则 */&#10;.button {&#10;  background: red;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 改写后 */&#10;[data-qiankun=&#39;product&#39;] .button {&#10;  background: red;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 原始规则 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 改写后 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">data-qiankun</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>局限：无法隔离通过 JS 动态创建的样式、<code>@keyframes</code> 动画名冲突、<code>:root</code> 伪类规则。</p>\n<h3 id=\"shadow-dom\">Shadow DOM</h3><p>最强的浏览器原生隔离方案。每个子应用渲染在一个 Shadow Root 内，外部样式无法穿透：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const host = document.createElement(&#39;div&#39;);&#10;const shadow = host.attachShadow({ mode: &#39;open&#39; });&#10;shadow.innerHTML = `&lt;style&gt;.button { background: blue; }&lt;/style&gt;`;&#10;document.body.appendChild(host);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> host</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shadow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> host.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">attachShadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ mode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shadow.innerHTML </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `&#x3C;style>.button { background: blue; }&#x3C;/style>`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(host);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代价：弹窗类组件（Modal/Tooltip/Dropdown）需要挂载到 Shadow Root 外部才能正确定位，导致逻辑复杂度上升。Ant Design 5.x 通过 <code>getPopupContainer</code> 配置缓解了这一问题，但仍需显式处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"css-modules-命名空间\">CSS Modules + 命名空间</h3><p>在构建时将类名编译为唯一 hash：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 编译前 */ .button { ... }&#10;/* 编译后 */ .product_button_x7k2f { ... }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 编译前 */</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 编译后 */</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .product_button_x7k2f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ... }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是最务实的方案——不依赖运行时机制，配合 BEM 命名约定可覆盖绝大多数场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dom-隔离\">DOM 隔离</h2><p>DOM 隔离的核心问题是「子应用的 DOM 查询会不会选中其他应用的节点」。解决方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>独立挂载点</strong>：每个子应用渲染到专属的容器 <code>&lt;div id=&quot;app-product&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code> 中</li>\n<li><strong>Shadow DOM</strong>：查询被限制在 Shadow Root 内</li>\n<li><strong>iframe</strong>：天然隔离，但牺牲了同页面交互体验</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"实际选型决策矩阵\">实际选型决策矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高安全需求（金融/政务）</td>\n<td>iframe 物理隔离（wujie）</td>\n<td>隔离最彻底，安全审计容易通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多应用频繁切换的后台</td>\n<td>Proxy 沙箱 + CSS Modules</td>\n<td>性能开销小，切换体验流畅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗留 jQuery 系统接入</td>\n<td>iframe</td>\n<td>旧系统改造成本最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新建系统、技术栈统一</td>\n<td>CSS Modules + 构建隔离</td>\n<td>运行时零开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>JS 沙箱经历了快照 → Proxy → iframe 物理隔离三代演进</li>\n<li>Proxy 沙箱适合大多数场景；iframe 物理隔离适合强安全需求</li>\n<li>CSS 隔离推荐 CSS Modules + 命名空间作为基线方案</li>\n<li>Shadow DOM 隔离最强但对 UI 组件库有侵入性要求</li>\n<li>隔离不是越强越好——过度隔离会增加通信成本和调试难度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"routing-communication\">路由协调与跨应用通信</a> — 隔离之后如何打通必要的交互</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations/wasm-core-concepts\">Web Components hub — 核心概念</a> 的 Shadow DOM 原理部分；另见 <a href=\"../design-systems/implementation/token-component-integration\">设计系统 hub — Token 与组件集成</a> 中关于跨 Shadow DOM 主题传递的讨论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隔离与沙箱机制","id":"隔离与沙箱机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JS 沙箱的三代演进","id":"js-沙箱的三代演进"},{"level":3,"text":"第一代：快照沙箱（Snapshot Sandbox）","id":"第一代-快照沙箱-snapshot-sandbox"},{"level":3,"text":"第二代：Proxy 代理沙箱","id":"第二代-proxy-代理沙箱"},{"level":3,"text":"第三代：iframe 物理隔离","id":"第三代-iframe-物理隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"CSS 隔离策略","id":"css-隔离策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Scoped CSS（选择器前缀）","id":"scoped-css-选择器前缀"},{"level":3,"text":"Shadow DOM","id":"shadow-dom"},{"level":3,"text":"CSS Modules + 命名空间","id":"css-modules-命名空间"},{"level":2,"text":"DOM 隔离","id":"dom-隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"实际选型决策矩阵","id":"实际选型决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"微前端架构模式与适用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/architecture-patterns"},"next":{"title":"路由协调与跨应用通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/routing-communication"}}